# Interview drafts are scratch files holding a person's answers. One is
# tracked on purpose: the made-up example the public site publishes. The
# contract skill's measurement draft, which its limits were set against
# (spec v4.2 on #313), is named .measured.json, so it is a test fixture and
# never an artifact the site publishes.
*.interview.json
!skills/contract/examples/release-notes.interview.json
# Output of claude plugin eval runs. It can hold local paths and session text,
# so it is read, summarised on the issue, and deleted, never committed.
evals/results/
